HST Office: the recovery dialog shows when each copy was made and where the document came from.

- svx docrecoveryrecoverdialog.ui + docrecovery.cxx: a column "Autosaved at" (time and date of the
  recovery copy, UI locale) and, as the tooltip of a row, the original file path or "Never saved".
- svx strings.hrc + vi messages.po: the new strings. The wording of the dialogs (one term "khôi phục",
  a true text when something could not be recovered, the emergency save text) is in
  l10n/vi-overrides.jsonl.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/unit/test_recovery_durability_patches.py.
